notes:
I tool MCP generici (binary_info, triage_analyze, analyze_strings, analyze_full, binary_hexdump) operano su PE/ELF/Mach-O e non riconoscono i magic DEX (dex
035), VDEX (vdex), AXML (0x0003), IDSG, OAT (oat
), ART (art
) ne' la struttura ZIP centrale APK; non restituiscono campi loader-android-specifici (format, entries[], manifest.package, permissions, signing_schemes, dex_count, opcode histogram) confrontabili 1:1 con le funzioni Python.
